    <details class="mt-2" id="eos-wlevel-edit" @(Model.WeaponLevelErrorMessage is not null ? "open" : "")>
        <summary class="small"><i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right-dots"></i> Set weapon level, rarity &amp; overboost in a NeverCrisis account</summary>
        <div class="card card-body mt-2" style="max-width: 860px;">
            <p class="small mb-2">
                Upload the server's <code>data\account.json</code> to list the weapons it owns, add the ones you want and set each one's rarity,
                level cap, level and overboost, then download the updated file. <strong>Max</strong> sets the top rarity, a level cap of 140,
                the level cap and full overboost.
